1200 GOSUB 6340:BM$="Susanna: Oh my gosh, this is delicious! It's been so long since I last had\sukiyaki! And this soy soup goes perfectly with the meat!":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1210 GOSUB 6300:BM$="David: What are these noodles? I thought they were tofu but they're\different... crisper. They've absorbed the soup, so they're almost better\than the meat.":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1220 GOSUB 6340:BM$="Susanna: That's a kind of diet food called konjac. You should eat the meat\and build up your stamina. I'll eat the konjac and watch my calories!":GOSUB 5100
1230 BM$="The two of them were very impressed by the quality of the onigiri and the\sukiyaki, which they happily devoured.":GOSUB 5100
1240 GOSUB 6100:BM$="From the nearby table, Clark and Vince were keeping an eye on them.":GOSUB 5100
1250 GOSUB 6320:BM$="Vince: Chief, the sushi's good but the sukiyaki looks divine. Oh man, that\soup smells -\Huh? Chief, the customer that just came in is walking towards Susanna.":GOSUB 5100
