1260 BM$="A middle-aged man greeted Susanna.":GOSUB 5100
1270 GOSUB 5200:ISET X:GOSUB 6110:GOSUB 6340:BM$="Susanna: David, this is Mr. Dimir from Dimir Music. He's taking care of our\performances in Italy.":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1280 GOSUB 6330:BM$="Dimir: I'm Dimir, pleased to meet you. I came here to meet a colleague from a\Japanese music firm and I happened to notice the two of you. It's nice to\finally meet you in person, Mr. David.":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1290 GOSUB 6340:BM$="Susanna: Please, take a seat with us, Mr. Dimir.":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1300 GOSUB 6330:BM$="Dimir: Rome must be smaller than I thought. I never would've guessed I'd\find you here. Are you visiting Piazza di Spagna?":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1310 GOSUB 6340:BM$="Susanna: Yes, though our main reason for being here was to find out more\about a certain crest.":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1320 GOSUB 6330:BM$="Dimir: A crest, you say? Collecting photos and drawings of coats of arms is\actually a hobby of mine. What kind of crest would that be?":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1330 GOSUB 6120:W1=0:BM$="David unfolded the cloth, revealing the crest.":GOSUB 5100
1340 GOSUB 6300:BM$="David: This is it. We've been hitting all the libraries we could find, but we\couldn't find this specific crest in any reference book.":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1350 GOSUB 6330:BM$="Dimir: I have to admit, this is the first time I see such a magnificent crest.\Where did you find it? Would you mind parting with it?":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1360 GOSUB 6300:BM$="David: I'd like to find out to which family it belongs first. Once I do, I'll gladly\let you have it.":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1370 GOSUB 6330:BM$="Dimir: You know, a long time ago, the British used to consult a fortune\teller when looking for someone or something in Rome. The fortune tellers\here are particularly accurate, you see.":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1380 GOSUB 6300:BM$="David: A fortune teller, huh...":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1390 GOSUB 6330:BM$="Dimir: If you're considering it, I can introduce you to a good place I know.":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1400 GOSUB 6340:BM$="Susanna: Talking to a fortune teller seems interesting. How about it,\David? It might be fun.":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1410 GOSUB 6330:BM$="Dimir: It's in the alley next to the nightclub `Paradise`. There should be a\sign that says `Nuszel`. It's pretty well known in the area, so if you ask\people around they should be able to point you in the right direction.":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1420 GOSUB 6340:BM$="Susanna: Thank you, Mr. Dimir. We'll go there as soon as we finish eating.":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1430 GOSUB 6330:BM$="Dimir: Once you find out what you need, please contact me. I'd really like to\have this crest.":GOSUB 5100
1440 GOSUB 6130:BM$="David and Susanna left the restaurant, tailed by Clark and Vince.":GOSUB 5100
